<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="{{or page.attributes.lang 'en'}}">
  <head>
{{> head}}
  </head>
  <body class="home">
    <div class="home-corner">
{{#if env.SITE_SEARCH_PROVIDER}}
      <div class="search hide-for-print">
        <div id="search-field" class="field">
          <input id="search-input" type="text" placeholder="Search the docs" autofocus>
        </div>
      </div>
{{/if}}
      <button class="theme-toggle" type="button" onclick="thinkubeToggleTheme()" aria-label="Toggle dark mode" title="Toggle dark mode">
          <svg class="icon-moon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21 12.8A9 9 0 1 1 11.2 3a7 7 0 0 0 9.8 9.8z"/></svg>
          <svg class="icon-sun" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4"/><path d="M12 2v2M12 20v2M4.9 4.9l1.4 1.4M17.7 17.7l1.4 1.4M2 12h2M20 12h2M4.9 19.1l1.4-1.4M17.7 6.3l1.4-1.4"/></svg>
        </button>
      <a href="https://github.com/thinkube/thinkube">GitHub</a>
    </div>
    <main class="home-main">

      <section class="hero">
        <span class="tk-icon hero-logo" role="img" aria-label="Thinkube"></span>
        <p class="hero-eyebrow">Your hardware · your models · your data</p>
        <h1 class="hero-title">Sovereign AI<br> <span class="accent">starts at your desk</span></h1>
        <p class="hero-sub">A complete AI development environment on your own machines: notebooks, your GPUs and
          your models, and a cluster to try what you build, all driven from a coding agent. Models, components and services
          load and unload as you need them, so your machine's limited resources go to the work you are doing now.</p>
        <div class="hero-cta">
          <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="start-here/what-is-thinkube.html">What Thinkube is</a>
          <a class="btn btn-primary" href="install/overview.html">Install</a>
          <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="#playbooks">Playbooks</a>
        </div>

        <ol class="loop" aria-label="The Thinkube AI loop">
          <li class="loop-node"><span class="tk-icon loop-num" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="loop-label">Get models</span></li>
          <li class="loop-node"><span class="tk-icon loop-num" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="loop-label">Fine-tune</span></li>
          <li class="loop-node"><span class="tk-icon loop-num" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="loop-label">Build apps</span></li>
          <li class="loop-node"><span class="tk-icon loop-num" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="loop-label">Evaluate</span></li>
        </ol>
      </section>

      <section class="cockpit">
        <div class="cockpit-copy">
          <span class="kicker">How you work</span>
          <h2 class="section-h">Every task is a sentence to your agent</h2>
          <p class="cockpit-lead">Thinkube is designed for you to work from a coding agent. The platform gives
            the agent its own tools for every part of it: when you ask, it sees which models are loaded,
            what each GPU is holding, how a deploy is going and what a service logged, and it runs the same
            operations you would run by hand. You decide what happens: the agent changes something only when you ask.
            Every playbook on this site starts with the sentence to say.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="codewin" role="img"
             aria-label="An agent session: deploy a template and load a model, driven by MCP tools.">
          <div class="codewin-bar">
            <span class="codewin-dots"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span>
            <span class="codewin-title">Thinkube IDE — agent</span>
          </div>
<pre class="codewin-body" aria-hidden="true"><code><span class="c-prompt">›</span> <span class="c-user">deploy the vLLM template and load Qwen3.5-4B</span>

<span class="c-claude">●</span> Deploying tkt-vllm-gradio.
  <span class="c-ok">✓</span> <span class="c-tool">deploy_template</span><span class="c-paren">(</span>tkt-vllm-gradio<span class="c-paren">)</span>       <span class="c-dim">→ pending</span>
  <span class="c-ok">✓</span> <span class="c-tool">get_deployment_status</span><span class="c-paren">(</span>…<span class="c-paren">)</span>              <span class="c-dim">→ building → running</span>

<span class="c-claude">●</span> Loading the model.
  <span class="c-ok">✓</span> <span class="c-tool">load_llm_model</span><span class="c-paren">(</span>Qwen/Qwen3.5-4B<span class="c-paren">)</span>         <span class="c-dim">→ loading · backend: vllm</span>
  <span class="c-ok">✓</span> <span class="c-tool">get_llm_model_status</span><span class="c-paren">(</span>…<span class="c-paren">)</span>               <span class="c-dim">→ available</span>

  Your app is at <span class="c-link">vllm.thinkube.com</span></code></pre>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="journeys">
        <h2 class="section-h">Four areas, one platform</h2>
        <div class="card-grid area-grid">
          <a class="card area-card area-kubernetes" href="kubernetes/index.html">
            <span class="card-edge card-edge-area">Thinkube Kubernetes</span>
            <span class="card-head"><span class="tk-icon tk-area-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span><h3 class="card-title">The base, ready and signed in</h3></span>
            <p class="card-desc">Unmodified upstream Kubernetes on your machines, with identity, storage, registry, database and GPUs ready, driven from a coding agent.</p>
          </a>
          <a class="card area-card area-gitops" href="apps/index.html">
            <span class="card-edge card-edge-area">Thinkube GitOps</span>
            <span class="card-head"><span class="tk-icon tk-area-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span><h3 class="card-title">Push to git, and it runs</h3></span>
            <p class="card-desc">From a template to an application at its own address behind your login. Each later change goes live when you push.</p>
          </a>
          <a class="card area-card area-models" href="lifecycle/index.html">
            <span class="card-edge card-edge-area">Thinkube Models</span>
            <span class="card-head"><span class="tk-icon tk-area-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span><h3 class="card-title">Serve, fine-tune, track</h3></span>
            <p class="card-desc">Open models on your own GPUs. Use them from notebooks and from your apps, at one address.</p>
          </a>
          <a class="card area-card area-tandem" href="tandem/index.html">
            <span class="card-edge card-edge-area">Thinkube Tandem</span>
            <span class="card-head"><span class="tk-icon tk-area-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span><h3 class="card-title">You and an agent, together</h3></span>
            <p class="card-desc">Ask in a chat, or build a change step by step. The agent does the work; you decide what happens.</p>
          </a>
        </div>
      </section>

{{#with (playbooks featured=true)}}
{{#if length}}
      <section class="journeys catalog" id="first-time">
        <span class="kicker">Playbooks</span>
        <h2 class="section-h">First time here?</h2>
        <div class="card-grid playbook-grid">
{{#each this}}
{{> playbook-card}}
{{/each}}
        </div>
      </section>
{{/if}}
{{/with}}

      <section class="journeys catalog" id="playbooks">
        <h2 class="section-h">All playbooks</h2>
        <div class="area-filter" role="group" aria-label="Show playbooks of one area">
          <button type="button" class="filter-chip is-active" data-filter="all" aria-pressed="true">All</button>
          <button type="button" class="filter-chip area-kubernetes" data-filter="kubernetes" aria-pressed="false">Thinkube Kubernetes</button>
          <button type="button" class="filter-chip area-gitops" data-filter="gitops" aria-pressed="false">Thinkube GitOps</button>
          <button type="button" class="filter-chip area-models" data-filter="models" aria-pressed="false">Thinkube Models</button>
          <button type="button" class="filter-chip area-tandem" data-filter="tandem" aria-pressed="false">Thinkube Tandem</button>
        </div>
        <div class="card-grid playbook-grid" id="playbook-grid">
{{#each (playbooks)}}
{{> playbook-card}}
{{/each}}
        </div>
      </section>

    </main>
{{> footer}}
  </body>
</html>
